  An extra HTML section. To use it, rename this file to  after-hero.html
  (it then appears right after the "hero" section).

  File names:  before-<section>.html  or  after-<section>.html
  Sections on this site: __SECTIONS__
  Styles go in custom.css; scripts go in custom.js (<script> tags here don't run).
-->
